WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.490
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.240
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:39.200
Hayama Akito, my natural
enemy and good friend.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.540
My manager, chauffeur, and
former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.870
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.330
I'm Babbit.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.710
My beloved Mama is a famous
Aoki-award winning novelist.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.380
"She's Here! Mother's Mother"

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.720
Here's your manuscript.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.760
But there's still half
a day until the deadline!

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.430
If you don't want it, I could burn it.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:05.680
No, I want it!

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.100
What's come over you, Mama?
This is unusual.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:12.440
From now on, I'm trying to
become an exemplary writer.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.740
Onda, I know I've been quite
a nuisance up until now.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.580
S- Sensei, I'm touched!

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:27.120
Your words make all the trouble
I've gone through up to now worthwhile!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:27.790
Really?

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.790
Yes! And now, I'm going
right back to the office!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.630
Be careful.

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:31.380
Right!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:34.380
--Skip! Skip! La-la-la-la...!
--Wow. Mama, you sure have grown.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.710
I'm touched as well.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:36.880
It's just the cover.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:37.720
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.390
The manuscript inside it
is from three years ago.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:43.720
Onda is still quite the rookie, isn't he?

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.720
Sensei, you're such a scamp.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.850
Now then, I think I'll treat
myself to a little tub time,

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:49.730
and maybe sprinkle in
some mineral bath salts.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.400
Kusatsu is such a nice place...

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.060
Mama...

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:55.320
To be so carefree, after
tricking someone like that...

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.400
Yes, coming!

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.070
Huh?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.080
I am Kurata Shizuka.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.420
Kurata Shizuka?

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:19.090
I am her second-in-charge, Katagiri Sanzo.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.430
What's going on, Rei-kun?

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.090
Oh, Sana-chan, is that you?

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.100
Grandma!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.430
Grandma?

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.560
In her first appearance!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.060
W-w-wha...?

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.060
Incredible! This many
hot spring manju buns?

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.740
You've grown so much! The last time
I saw you, you were only this big.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:40.570
That was the year of
the Barcelona Olympics,

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.070
so it would have been
four years ago.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.070
I was in 2nd grade!

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.070
What is "Kurata Inn"?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.450
I run a small inn among
the Kusatsu hot springs

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.080
that has been in
operation for 300 years.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.080
That's ridiculously big!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.830
Beginning with Mito-no-Goroko,

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:58.420
who stopped by during his travels
while compiling the History of Japan,

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.260
there have been many prominent
figures who have stayed at Kurata Inn

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.090
while passing through Kusatsu.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.720
M- Mito-no-Goroko!?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.760
Incredible...

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.770
To think that you were an
acquaintance of Mito Komon!

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.770
That was back during the Edo period!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.440
I heard that story once
from Mama a long time ago.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.440
Ah, this one is chunky-style!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.440
In your case, you really did
choose dumplings over flowers.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.780
So did you, right?

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:24.110
Incidentally, where is Misako?

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.120
Grandma here would be scary
to run into on the road at night.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.120
Flowers blossom even in the hot water...

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.240
"Misako-san is busy. Do not open!!"

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.540
--Why has Mother suddenly
showed up here once again?
--Yes... Yes... That's right...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.540
--Don't tell me she still hasn't
given up yet about that one matter.
--I'm just saying, why now?

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.380
Yes...

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.630
This is Kusatsu Babbit, from the
White Bat Kusatsu branch office.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.380
This here is Kurata Inn, folks.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.720
Look, once she has spoken,
she won't listen to anyone anyhow.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.720
It's been so long, why don't you just have
a nice mother-daughter talk, Misako-san?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:53.390
After all, you are the only
daughter of the Kurata family.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.400
Dad! How can you be so carefree,
like it was someone else's business!?

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.360
No matter what anyone says,
I am not going back to Kusatsu-

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.400
-are you listening to me, Dad!?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.070
Father? Hello? Yoboseyo?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:04.740
Here you are, sir.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.160
Yes, I'm listening.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.740
Please let your father have some time
to relax without your mother around.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.080
Okay, well, I've got eight more baths
to clean, so I'm going to hang up now.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.210
Oh, right, the buses left here about 6:30,

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.080
so they should be getting
there right about now.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.960
Okay, Misako-san, you take care now. Bye.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.760
Dad! What do you mean,
the buses have left!?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:26.630
"Kurata Inn"

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.430
"Kurata Misako-sama Matchmaker Tour"

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.430
Okay, everyone, thank you
for your patience.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.060
--W- what's with the fleet of buses!?
--We're going to be calling
you in order now...

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.060
In any case, I have to get out of here!

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.230
Let's get zooming, Shooting Star!

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:39.020
Huh? Mother, long time no see.
You're looking well.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.360
Late into autumn, Mama finds herself
frightened by Mama's own Mama.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.610
Too many syllables.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.660
"Matchmaking for Mama?"

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.700
Very well, will the first
gentleman please enter?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.080
First! Hailing from Kusatsu, in Gunma
Prefecture, I am Okegawa Hachitaro.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.420
This man is the Kusatsu Hot
Spring Board Chairman's third son.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:00.420
Misako-san, you often played with
him when you were both children.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.090
Hello.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.300
So, what are your interests?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.760
I do a little karaoke.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.720
The next gentleman.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:14.100
Coming! Hailing from Kusatsu, in Gunma
Prefecture, I am Tadokoro Seiichi.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.770
This is the Kusatsu Tourism
Society President's second son.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:20.100
See? He's just the sort of
handsome man that you like, right?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.730
Um, what sports are you good at?

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.610
I play a little ping pong.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.400
The next gentleman.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.070
Yes, hailing from Kusatsu,
in Gunma Prefecture-

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.450
The next gentleman.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.700
Yes, hailing from Kusatsu-

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.700
The next gentleman.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:35.040
Y- yes, hailing from Kusat-

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:35.700
The next gentleman.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.710
Yes, hailing from Kusatsu-

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.370
The next gentleman.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.210
Yes, hailing from Kusatsu-

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.040
All of these men are local

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.710
to Kusatsu, aren't they, Mother?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.970
I can see right through your little
scheme to bring me back to Kusatsu.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.180
Coincidence.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.640
What's more, these are all

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.560
thin, Wiggly, silly little men.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:58.480
Isn't that the type of man you like?
I mean, look at Kashima Ryosuke-san.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:01.060
Lend me some money?

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.400
I was still immature at the time.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.400
In a marriage, you see, Misako-san,

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:10.400
it doesn't matter if the husband is wiggly
or silly, as long as the wife remains firm.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.740
If anything, it's easier that way.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.200
Huh? Me?

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.910
In any case, I absolutely
refuse to have that type of man!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.210
That's hot!

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.090
The next gentleman.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.090
Oh, Onda!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.090
Who is this man?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.420
Sensei!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.090
"Onda, you fool!! Heh heh heh heh"

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.090
What kind of a trick is this!?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.010
Would you please out it out, already!?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.010
There, there...

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:39.020
And who are you, eh!? What kind of attitude
is that to be taking toward Madam Misako!?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.350
Okay...

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.350
That guy is scary.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.270
How terribly rude of me.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.360
I was unaware that you were one
of the Madam's business associates.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.860
Y- yeah...

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:52.360
Forgive the belated introductions. I am
Katagiri, second-in-charge at Kurata Inn.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.700
He is a candidate to be the
next head clerk at Kurata Inn.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.700
Not at all. I am by no means up to it.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.700
Head clerk, head clerk, head clerk-san,

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.710
the man who looks after the guests' needs.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.370
Head clerk, head clerk, head clerk-san,

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.380
his post is the most important one there.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.880
So does that mean that Mama's
matchmaking session is over?

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.720
I had just forgotten about that!
Don't go opening your big mouth!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.050
Misako-san, you are the
Kurata family's only child.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.390
You are the only one
who can take over Kurata Inn,

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.390
which has gone on for 300 years.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.770
Mother, do you seriously think I am
cut out to be the mistress of an inn?

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.520
"Kurata Inn"

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.060
Welcome!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.730
Thank you for having us.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.110
Hi! Come on in, come on in, come on in!

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.030
Yahoo!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.240
Out of the way, out of the way!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.960
If I were to take over Kurata Inn,

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:48.130
your precious 300-year history
would be over in three days, Mother.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.800
"Prospective fathers return home"

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.720
Aw, my phantom fathers are going home.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.390
She was such a cute young lady.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.390
Huh? Me?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.390
Madam Misako.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.730
A cute Sensei?

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:03.980
Mama was?

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:10.320
Please wait for me, Madam Misako! Madam!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.730
--That is cute.
--That's not cute.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.950
Just as soon as she entered women's
college, she fell prey to that beast.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:23.450
There was one letter that arrived, saying
she would not be returning to Kusatsu.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.250
Afterward, she found a child
who had been abandoned...

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.420
Abandoned child? You mean me?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.340
Oh, that was a slip of the
tongue. Please excuse me.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.840
Don't worry, don't worry, it's the truth.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.010
Everyone in Japan
knows the story, after all.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.930
Still, regardless of the details,

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:43.350
there is no mistake that Sana-chan is,
in fact, Misako-sensei's daughter.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.680
Yes.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:49.520
--Things head off in another direction!!
--I'm starting to want to go
to the hot springs now...

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:54.030
With Misako-san's taste in husbands
having changed, my strategy has failed.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:57.700
Could the Madam just not
wish to take over Kurata Inn?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.700
I will not allow Kurata Inn to
come to an end after my generation!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.700
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.580
If Misako-san will not take over
Kurata Inn, then who on earth will?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.710
Does Grandma have
something sneaky in mind?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.050
I've only ever seen Grandma two
other times before now, you know.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.380
Oh, this one is white bean!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:19.390
And the Kusatsu hot springs
are fairly close by, too.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.890
It's unusual for her not to come visit

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.060
her cute grandchild and
daughter for four years.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.640
Sana-chan's house is right around here,

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.310
while the Kusatsu hot
springs are over here.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.810
I guess that's still hard to tell, huh?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.230
Unusual? I don't know.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:34.650
After all, the inn must be busy
during summer and winter vacations.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.700
Besides, Mama and Grandma seem
to be pretty crabby to each other.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.990
Oh, but we get a New-Year's
Card from Grandma every year.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.370
If she were her blood granddaughter,

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.040
I'm sure she would come
see her more frequently.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.750
There's no way she'd fail
to come see her for four years.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.000
I feel bad for Sana-chan.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.170
Well now, it appears
that Mother has given up,

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.340
so let's have a big party tonight.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.340
Shimura, call the liquor
store and fish shop!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.720
Right!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.890
S- Sensei, our deadline is-

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:01.680
Yow-ow-ow-ow!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.050
--My word, Onda, are you still here?
--I'm going bald!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.600
I'm surprised you could get under
there. I have to give you credit.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.890
--I feel sorry for Onda-san, too.
--These are yummy.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.070
Oh, these are the best!

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.400
Rei-kun still doesn't have
any idea what's going on.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.910
I've got a bad feeling, like
something terrible is going to happen.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.580
Lend me some money?

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.380
Welcome to our shop.
May I take your order?

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.050
I'll have Spaghetti Vongole,
heavy on the Tabasco,

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:43.390
a jumbo pirate salad, a fruit pawfait,
and Milfie espresso, if you please.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:48.390
I'll take a mild beef curry,
a semisweet chocolate cake, taiyaki,

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.730
and a lowfat milk banana shake.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.390
Okay, one moment please.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:53.480
Thank you for waiting!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:57.780
Wow, that looks delicious! You piled
them awl into one stack for us?

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.740
So how are we supposed to eat that!?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.450
Whose idea was it to bring
them out like this!?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.660
This is delicious!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.790
There, you see?

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:14.420
That was last week's "Child's Toy".
This is this week's.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.460
You'll laugh at this week's!
Just you watch, Grandma!

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.760
Aw, it hoits! I'm gonna die!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:20.460
Me too.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.430
Um, Noise-san, hurry up!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.800
Hi, welcome, come on in!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.810
Let me take your temperature.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.770
Aren't these used to measure the
temperature in the room and such?

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.060
Don't go contradicting the angel in white.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.730
So, what seems to be the trouble?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.730
That's what we came here
to find out, you know!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.070
Ah, is that right?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:42.070
My tummy is rumbling, I have a splitting
headache, and my throat is sore.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.410
Could it be some kind of nasty disease?

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.070
Search me.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:48.080
Huh? Soich me? You are
the noise, aren't you?

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.740
No, I am...

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.080
...the cook, you see!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.000
Hey, now...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.960
That was great! Right? Right? Did you
see that? Did you see that, Grandma?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.760
That's the kind of work
I've been doing lately.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.760
Indeed, that was absolutely wonderful.
I, Katagiri, am deeply impressed.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.760
What, really?

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.760
This will work!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.760
Katagiri!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:10.720
Yes?

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.600
Something is about to start.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.770
You're going to leave
Kurata Inn to Sana-chan?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.110
Are you sure about that, Mistress?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:21.110
There is nobody else besides her.
Make preparations at once!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.280
As you wish.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:25.450
What a cold grandmother she must be,

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.120
to watch Sana-chan's sketches
and not even chuckle.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:32.370
In that case, we'll challenge her to
watch Sana-chan's commercial series next!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.040
Rei-kun, what have you been mumbling to
yourself about for the past few moments?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.710
Sana-chan, this will show
that straitlaced old lady-

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.710
Sana-chan...

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.710
Yes?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.050
...that grandmother, that grandmother,
that fine, fine grandmother of yours...

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.380
Rei-kun, you're just
making it worse and worse.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.720
Sana-chan, do you like working on TV?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:51.060
Mm-hmm. At first, when Mama suggested
it, I didn't think it was that great,

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.720
but lately, I think it has
been getting a little more fun.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.060
You have to stay smiling all the time.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.020
Sana-chan, you're so cheerful,

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.730
I'm sure you must be a popular figure,
well-liked by many people.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.070
You bet she is!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.480
Let me tell you, right now,

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.070
Sana-chan is loved on the lower
end by babies and toddlers,

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.740
and at the upper end,
by grandmothers and grandfathers,

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.740
Americans, Indians, and even aliens!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.830
She is the number one personality
sought after to do commercials!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.740
If you will watch this video,
I'm sure you will agree-

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:17.920
Grandma has completely forgotten what
a wonderful little granddaughter she has.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.080
Forgive me, okay?

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.090
Not at all. I'm not bothered one bit.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:25.420
From now on, let's be closer
with each other, okay, Sana-chan?

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:28.430
Before I go home to Kusatsu,
I'd like to see the sights of Tokyo.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.090
Will you show me around?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.260
Mm-hmm, Grandma.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:35.220
She really is... she really
is a nice grandmother.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.070
"Ruse"

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.730
Grandma...

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.070
Ah, I want to go to the hot springs.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.070
And over there is Tokyo Tower.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.070
Come to think of it,
where did Katagiri-san go?

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:49.070
I sent him on a bit of an errand.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:50.490
Ah, I see.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.080
What is he doing?

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.080
This is the TV studio where we
do "Child's Toy". Isn't it huge?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.090
Yes? I see. Understood.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:10.090
Excuse me, Driver, there's someplace I'd
like to go. Could I prevail upon you?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.090
Sure!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.760
We have been waiting for you.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.100
Katagiri-san...

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:20.440
Hm? Who is that boy with the
unusual aura coming off of him?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:23.110
Allow me to introduce him. This is...

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.110
This!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.440
This?

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.440
This!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.440
This?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:31.110
This is such a pleasure to meet you! I'm...

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.030
Tori!

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.370
Tori?

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.030
Tori!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.030
Tori?

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:38.700
Tori... Tori-Tori-Tori-Tori...

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.040
Toriyama Noboru.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.870
He is 14 years old.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.540
--As it happens,
--She's exactly, exactly
how she looks on TV.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.710
Toriyama-kun here is a
big fan of Madam Sana.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.710
I'm Sana!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.050
I am Sana-chan's manager-

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:53.050
Well now, why don't we drink some tea
and have ourselves a nice little chat?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:53.890
Okay!

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:55.550
Okay.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:05.900
Why does this seem so formal?
It's almost as though this were-

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.150
"Matchmaking for Sana?"

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.230
Matchmaking?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.690
This is so wonderful!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:16.740
Right now, the real Sana-chan is sitting
right in front of me. I'm so bowled over!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.410
Well, I'm very much obliterated
that you are bowled over.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.410
"Much obliged."

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.880
I- I make sure to v- videotape

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:28.420
and watch "Child's Toy" every
week, without fail, Ma'am...

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.760
Who do you mean, "Ma'am"?

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.630
This is so wonderful!

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:37.680
T- the sketches that you and
Zenjiro-san do are always so comical...

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.270
Toriyama-kun, you're
fairly comical, yourself.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.020
Really?

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.560
Mm-hmm. Look there...

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.360
Oh, no!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.030
I have to do something...
I have to do something...

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:52.530
The prestigious middle school
that I go to in Kusatsu

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.410
uses the escalator system
through high school and college,

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.080
and in the future, I would
like to study hotel management.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:02.120
Yeah, hotel studies? My grandma
happens to run an inn in Kusatsu.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.410
Isn't that a coincidence?

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:06.710
Coincidence? I- I don't
think it's a coincidence.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.750
If it were a coincidence, then-

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.380
We've been set up!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:12.590
It's not "almost as though",
that's precisely what this is!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.390
It's true! Since she failed to
find a match for you, Sensei,

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:18.760
now she's after Sana-chan!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.430
A matchmaking meeting
for Sana, huh? But why?

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:25.440
Could it be that she is scheming
to leave Kurata Inn to Sana now?

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:27.100
That's what I would probably guess.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.900
Yay! Lucky!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.070
Let them proceed, let them proceed!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:33.360
Now that you mention it, her personality
is suited to being the mistress of an inn.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:37.860
That's my mother's judgment for you!
She's sharp! I approve!

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.530
You intend to sacrifice
your own daughter, Sensei!?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:44.870
What did Sana say? As long as Sana
is okay with it, I'm okay with it.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.210
And if you want, why don't you
go along with Sana to Kusatsu

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.170
and serve as Kurata Inn's head clerk?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.590
H- head clerk...?

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.260
I wonder if I'm fit to be a head clerk...

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.720
Hey, now...

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.050
This way, please.
This way, please.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.560
Mistress, the folks from
the Babbit firm have arrived.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.390
You have all shown up so early...

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:10.150
"Waaah! You've got it all wrong!"

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:10.360
Mistress, that's The Godmother!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.070
Oh, yeah.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.690
Mistress, you just can't give
up your "Child's Toy" ways!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.860
It could work...

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.070
This week's Sana-chan.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.990
You'll all have to excuse me.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.580
There'll be a hundred kids!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.410
Mm-hmm! It's better to have lots
of brothers and sisters, huh?

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.080
It will be a lively family!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.250
That would be best.
Want to sing, Toriyama-kun?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.420
What, now?

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.300
"Sana-chan sings"

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.340
You're going to sing, right?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.340
♪ A lively family is a fun family! ♪

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.340
♪ A fun family and a delightful family! ♪

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.340
♪ Delightful, thrilling,
pleasant and warm! ♪

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.510
♪ Head clerk, head clerk,
a fine head clerk! ♪

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.510
♪ Maintain dignity,
treat the guests well! ♪

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:44.680
♪ That's what it takes
to be a fine head clerk! ♪

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.680
Hey, aren't you adapting
a little too quickly?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.690
♪ Come now, let's just enjoy ourselves! ♪

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.690
♪ It's been entertaining and
funny, thanks for coming! ♪

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.020
It would appear that those
two are getting along well.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:55.030
Yeah, what bliss!

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.070
Huh? Hey, if it isn't Hayama!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.200
I don't get it.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.370
Let's see, where is Hayama's Burutcha...

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.700
Nope, I guess it's this one.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.950
S- Sana-chan, s- shut mine off!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.870
This is Hayama Akito.
He's in the same class as me.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.670
I guess you could call him my good friend.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.540
Good afternoon.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.170
Good afternoon.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.380
Did you just bow?

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.720
Wah! I missed it!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.050
M- Mistress...

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.050
This boy...

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:25.720
I like the look in his eyes!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.060
It seems like I've heard someone
else say that somewhere...

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.560
Mama said it earlier!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.350
You're Hayama-kun, are you?
Do you like hot springs?

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.770
Not especially. I've never been.

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.240
W-who do you think you are!?

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.030
Don't you think it's rude
to just come barging in here!?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.700
Who are you?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.700
I... I... I am Sana-chan's betrothed!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:46.370
What!?

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.370
How do you like that? Give up?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.720
Those eyes... aren't human...

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.060
Neither are yours!

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.060
Well, I've got karate. Thanks for the cake.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.060
H- hey!

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.740
Hey, what's the big idea, eating
cake and running like that?

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.070
Hayama-kun- he's a good boy, isn't he?

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.570
Huh? Him, a good boy?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:26.910
You should take a boy like that
and carefully manipulate him,

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.240
right in the palm of your hand,

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:30.830
and once he's grown up to be a good
man, promote him to be your boyfriend.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.670
Huh? Seems like I've heard
those words before...

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.330
Mama said it earlier! She's her
mother's daughter, all right.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.340
Okay then, home with you, Toriyama!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.960
Sana-chan! You are my whole life!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:42.670
Don't say such an unpleasant thing!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:45.720
To celebrate Grandma coming to see
us for the first time in four years,

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.050
Cheers!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:50.390
Sensei, thank you so much!
Thanks to you, I've kept my job!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.390
Have I ever once been late
with one of my manuscripts?

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:54.730
Yes, you have, many times.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:56.730
Here you go, help yourself to some food.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.070
Wow, Shimura-san, that looks delicious!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:03.610
Mother, at your age, perhaps you
shouldn't have so much greasy food.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.910
Mama went flying...

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:09.080
The Mistress... has been turned down
by her only daughter, Misako-san,

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:13.250
to take over for her at Kurata Inn.
I think she is now grasping at straws.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.920
Is that why she set up
a matchmaking meeting

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.080
for elementary school-aged Sana-chan?

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:20.090
Next year she will be in middle
school, and before long, high school.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:21.920
There is no guarantee that at some time,

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.090
she won't run into a devil
like Kashima Ryosuke.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.430
Lend me money?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.430
Once that happens, it will be too late.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.100
I wonder if that isn't
what she was thinking.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.430
I get it. There is some truth to that.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:34.100
Are you going to take over Kurata Inn?

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.100
It does sound like it
would be pretty fun, huh?

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.440
Well, a long-established
hot springs inn,

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.770
where you are greeted by a popular
former child star mistress.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.440
If you were the mistress, there's no
doubt that you would do great business.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.200
I'll think about it.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.110
I'm sure that Sana-chan will be successful
in whatever field she goes into.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:50.780
I will stay with Sana-chan for
the rest of her life, after all.

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.450
How are you going to stay with her?

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.790
Here, you see, I've already started
to study up on being a head clerk.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.750
Huh? But Katagiri-san is going
to be the head clerk, right?

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.460
Don't suddenly start
looking at him as your rival!

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:05.470
I do think that will be much
farther down the road, though.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:09.470
Time has a way of
passing you by all at once.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.470
Mother, you are getting
along in years yourself,

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:14.930
so if you make up too many crazy schemes,
it's going to be bad for your health.

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:18.140
Okay, all together now...

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:20.480
Be sure to come by Kusatsu sometime!

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:23.150
Sana-chan, take care of Misako!

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:24.820
We will see you later!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:27.150
Grandma, you take care, too!

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:29.160
Hello? Father?

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:33.240
Huh? She's coming home already?
She should have stayed longer.

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:38.420
My nerves couldn't take it if she had.
Father, take care of Mother for me.

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:42.170
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:47.670
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.390
In dire straits,

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:55.970
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.850
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:04.940
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:10.990
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.200
...panic!!

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:19.040
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:21.750
he's there.

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.000
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:27.590
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.090
...for two.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.550
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:38.310
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:41.900
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:46.610
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:52.200
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:54.870
he's there,

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.040
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.620
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.120
...for two.

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.460
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.460 --> 00:24:11.800
Rei-kun suddenly gets into a car crash!

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:14.140
What's the matter with you, staring off
somewhere else while you're driving?

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:15.800
Mm-hmm, I see, your
girlfriend, Asako-san,

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:17.810
has to do her first
kissing scene in a drama.

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:20.480
What's more, in the show, she's engaged
to this guy, Kimuchi Takuya-kun.

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:24.650
It's no wonder you'd be
spacing off. This is not good!

00:24:24.650 --> 00:24:28.480
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 30,
the "Sagami, the Heartbroken Man" saga,

00:24:28.480 --> 00:24:32.150
